      "turnId": "d946fccd-6f44-46af-af47-ba57e2ba487c",
      "text": "Softness is not enough. Pancakes soak up syrup and lose their texture, while waffles keep a crisp edge."
    },
    {
      "playerId": "0e8b995e-a6d8-4efd-bdd6-64def8392788",
      "roundId": "775d4d34-be9d-4929-a79f-2516f438c012",
      "turnId": "e437dc28-834b-4542-a857-109a044ec719",
      "text": "Pancakes are my favorite breakfast."
    },
    {
